 "Soul Point Bombs": "灵魂点数炸弹",
 "Throw a crazy party around you! Music will start playing and mobs will dance. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在你身边整一场疯狂派对！音乐一响，怪物跟着蹦迪。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Send {~} random Ingredients to every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向你所在世界的每一位玩家送出 {~} 份随机素材。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Restore {~} Charges to the Teleportation Scrolls of every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "为你所在世界每一位玩家的传送卷轴恢复 {~} 次使用次数。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Activates all regular World Events on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "启动你所在世界的所有常规世界事件。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Increase the amount of Loot in every Loot Chest on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，提高你所在世界每一个宝箱的战利品数量。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Give free entry to all Dungeons on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，你所在世界的所有地牢都可以免费进入。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Send a filled Loot Chest's worth of items to every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向你所在世界的每一位玩家送出相当于一整箱宝箱的物品。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Double all loot dropped by mobs in your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，你所在世界的怪物掉落全部翻倍。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Send a message to every player online on Wynncraft. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向 Wynncraft 上每一位在线玩家送出一条消息。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Double the Profession XP gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，你所在世界每一位玩家的专业经验获取翻倍。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Double the Combat XP gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，你所在世界每一位玩家的战斗经验获取翻倍。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
 "Double the Soul Point gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分钟内，你所在世界每一位玩家的灵魂点数获取翻倍。炸弹使用后即消耗。",
